  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFEX 2025-2027 - IFEX 2025-27</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFEX 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFEX is a global network of more than 100 organisations in over 70 countries around the world, dedicated to defend and promote freedom of expression and information as a fundamental human right.

IFEX has developed a new five-year strategy for the period 2025-2029. The strategy focuses on four thematic areas, each of them with an overall goal:
1) Right to information - The challenges of access to information, its circulation and integrity, are confronted.
2) Civic Space - Civil society enabled and civic space protected as it relates to Freedom of Expression and Information (FoE&amp;I).
3) Safety and Justice - A safer environment for those exercising their right to FoE&amp;I.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till yttrandefrihetsn&#xe4;tverket IFEX om totalt 51 MSEK under en tre&#xe5;rs period den 2025-2027. F&#xf6;r denna period har IFEX utvecklat en strategi, med fokus p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande tematiska omr&#xe5;den:

1) &quot;Right to information&quot; - med m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen att addressera de olika utmaningar som finns kring r&#xe4;tten och tillg&#xe5;ng till information.

2) &quot;Civic space&quot; - med m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen att de som f&#xf6;rsvarar yttrandefrihet och r&#xe4;tten till information och de utrymmen som finns st&#xe4;rks och skyddas.

3) &quot;Safety and justice&quot; - med m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen att skapa en s&#xe4;krare milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r de som ut&#xf6;var sin r&#xe4;tt till yttrandefrihet och information.</narrative>
  </description>
